<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-057" chapter-id="c-jinshu-057-jin067-xilong" source-id="s-jinshu-057-jin067-xilong">
  <p id="c-jinshu-057-jin067-xilong:begin" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-057-jin067-xilong:begin:m0000" ref="bfr_z7f_dfk">趙誘</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-057-jin067-xilong:begin:m0004" ref="bfr_z7f_dfk">元孫</persName>，淮南人也。世以將顯。州辟主簿。值刺史<persName id="c-jinshu-057-jin067-xilong:begin:m0025" ref="jlw_330_62b">郗隆</persName>被<persName id="c-jinshu-057-jin067-xilong:begin:m0028" ref="ee0_b2a_68e">齊王冏</persName>檄，使起兵討<persName id="c-jinshu-057-jin067-xilong:begin:m0037" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG">趙王倫</persName></p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-057-jin067-xilong:end" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">時<persName id="c-jinshu-057-jin067-xilong:end:m0001" ref="4vd_pg5_o8x">杜曾</persName>迎<persName id="c-jinshu-057-jin067-xilong:end:m0004" ref="kiy_6gd_i7y">第五猗</persName>於荊州作亂，<persName id="c-jinshu-057-jin067-xilong:end:m0013" ref="39o_b6y_n74">敦</persName>遣<persName id="c-jinshu-057-jin067-xilong:end:m0015" ref="bfr_z7f_dfk">誘</persName>與襄陽太守<persName id="c-jinshu-057-jin067-xilong:end:m0021" ref="o98_8k4_ro8">朱軌</persName>共距之。</p>
</text>
